Cell["\<\
THESE RULES MUST BE APPLIED IN THIS ORDER!!!
Also, now I want to first make a list of vertices, manipulate them and \
finally expand them\
\>", "Subtitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9719464905557203`*^9, 3.97194649388002*^9}, {
  3.971946555957514*^9, 3.971946562081526*^9}, {3.972012950241293*^9, 
